+                    "Destinatário original: " + to + "\n" + body, MessageStatus.SENT);
+        }
+        Message original = sentMessages.add("EMAIL", to, subject, body, MessageStatus.SENT);
+        sentMessages.add("EMAIL", ARCHIVE, "[Cópia] " + subject, body, MessageStatus.SENT);
